# Google OAuth Client ID — required for Google Drive backup feature.
#
# Setup steps:
#   1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#   2. Create a project (or use an existing one)
#   3. Enable the Google Drive API
#   4. Create an OAuth 2.0 credential → Web Application type
#   5. Add your app's origin to "Authorized JavaScript origins"
#      e.g. http://localhost:5173 for local dev, https://your-domain.com for production
#   6. Copy the Client ID below
#
# The Client ID is not secret — it is safe to embed in frontend code.
# Drive backups are stored in a private app folder visible only to this app.
#
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=534364499038-be5atffjobtkv8srqgl7cdtq4o4l53fl.apps.googleusercontent.com
